# Storybook configuration

- Follow **frontend rules** in `frontend.mdc`. Keep story files under `src/lib/components/<kebab-name>/*.stories.ts`.
- If you change the `stories` pattern in `main.ts`, verify `src/**/*.stories.*` is still picked up.
- When adding addons, avoid clashing with the existing `@storybook/sveltekit` setup; verify with `pnpm storybook` / `pnpm build-storybook`.
- Do not duplicate Vitest integration (`@storybook/addon-vitest`) settings that already live in the root `vite.config.ts`.
